For the duplicate-key detector with yaml.compose: 

```python
import yaml
def dup_top_level_keys(path):
    node = yaml.compose(path.read_text())
    if node is None or not isinstance(node, yaml.MappingNode): return {}
    seen={}; dups={}
    for k,v in node.value:
        name=k.value
        if name in seen: dups.setdefault(name,[]).append(v.start_mark.line+1)
        else: seen[name]=v.start_mark.line+1
    return dups
```
This gives all mapping top-level duplicate keys.

